Band Visual & Press Photoshoot Prompt: A trio on a flooded megacity rooftop at dusk, industrial scaffolding silhouetted against a vibrant, hazy sky of solar flare aurora and perpetual rain. Their patched-up utility techwear glows with internal bioluminescence, reflecting in puddles. Anya’s corroded double-neck guitar sparks with blue light; Kai manipulates a liquid-filled, glowing Hydro-Gong Synthesizer; Zee's hybrid drum kit is integrated with rusted conduits, sparking. Water drips and flows around them. The mood is defiant, urgent, euphoric, and deeply surreal.

Descriptive Mood or Vibe: Humid, hyper-vibrant, electrically charged, defiant, euphoric yet deeply melancholic, with a constant sense of impending beautiful catastrophe.

